  "description": "The archaeologically attested oppidum at modern Moulin \u00e0 Vent in the French commune of Pommiers is probably to be identified with the Noviodunum mentioned by Caesar. The oppidum was occupied from the late La T\u00e8ne period through the early Roman.",
